  textBox: {fileID: 846775400}
  charDelay: 0.03
  introLines:
  - "Well then, I haven\u2019t seen you here before. I recognize every face that
    passes by here.\n\n\n"
  - "Ah you\u2019re taking over for your father? I haven\u2019t seen him around here
    in awhile. \n\n\n"
  - 'You can buy your stock from me. I have a variety of shipments that come in daily,
    and you can sell them as long as you have the means to pay for them.

'
  - "You won\u2019t find a better price anywhere else so keep coming back eh?\n\n\n"
